{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553880/extras/Your_paragraph_text.png?t=1743497104\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hey!</strong>\u00a0Is your wife driving you up the wall? Are the kids constantly misbehaving? Is your boss blowing up your phone? Do you just want to take a break and mow your lawn? Well, now you can!\u00a0Try out <strong>A</strong> <strong>Game About Mowing Your Lawn Today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place in your small backyard.\u00a0Your grass is waiting for you. Will you cut it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553880/extras/store_page_gif.gif?t=1743497104\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of danger-filled mowing action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid land mines, rocks, and other traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 15\u00a0to 30\u00a0minute playthrough\u200b.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553880/extras/store_page_gif2.gif?t=1743497104\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553880/extras/Your_paragraph_text2.png?t=1743497104\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553880?t=1743497104","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553880?t=1743497104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553880/06cd040f25829f802c63b926397781a